#: src/app/[lang]/features/statistics-tags-tab/page.tsx:95
msgid "Category-based analytics answer what kind of expense a transaction is — groceries, transport, dining. Tags answer a different and equally important question: what was it for? A dinner tagged as a #work-lunch, a #vacation flight charged to the same “Travel” category as a commute, a shared dinner that needs a #split label — these distinctions only surface when you have a dedicated tag reporting layer."
